        model: '“It works, and that’s great. One residual risk is still open: only one shift leader can train the standard. If he drops out, it fades with new people. I suggest the production manager puts it in his own register, with a second trainer before June as the action. The decision log goes to the archive, and on Friday I’ll send the closure notification.”',
